Package: emreliability
Title: Test Reliability and CSEM in Educational Measurement
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Huan", "Liu", email = "liuhuanbnu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Won-Chan", "Lee", email = "won-chan-lee@uiowa.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("Min", "Liang", email = "liangminahu@gmail.com", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Huan Liu <liuhuanbnu@gmail.com>
Description: Provides functions for computing test reliability and conditional
    standard error of measurement (CSEM) based on the methods described in
    the Reliability in Educational Measurement chapter of the 5th edition of 
    "Educational Measurement" by Lee and Harris (2025, ISBN:9780197654965).
